</head>
<body>

  <main id="main-content" role="main">
    <header class="header-section">
      <h1>The Epidemiological Transition (1990-2024)</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Global health is undergoing a profound structural shift. While the total burden of communicable diseases has halved, non-communicable diseases (NCDs) have surged to become the dominant cause of global disability-adjusted life years (DALYs), profoundly impacting public health priorities.</p>

      <div class="legend-container">
        <span class="text-secondary" style="margin-right: 8px;">Disease Category:</span>
