        <h3>Rank Shift of Top 10 DALY Causes</h3>
        <p class="insight-text">Infectious diseases plummet while chronic conditions like Ischemic Heart Disease and Diabetes surge to the top.</p>
        <div class="chart-container" style="height: 800px;">
          <canvas id="slopeChart" role="img" aria-label="Slope chart showing rank changes of top causes from 1990 to 2024"></canvas>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Bottom Left: Income Group Disparity -->
